CORE
substitution-token.sh

^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
unsupported shell construct: parameter expansion that is part of a token in arithmetic
--
^VERIFICATION
--
The text of arithmetic expansions is the result of parameter expansion
and command substitution, which can be any expression: only expansions
that are operands of their own are supported. dash rejects postfix ++,
which other shells support.
